@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Contact";
}

<main aria-labelledby="title" class="contact-page">
    <h2 id="title" class="naslov text-center mb-4">Pronađi nas!</h2>
    <h3 class="text-center podnaslov mb-5">Tu u komšiluku</h3>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <address class="kontakt">
                    <p>
                        <strong>Adresa:</strong><br />
                        Novosadskog sajma 21, L2<br />
                        Novi Sad
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Telefon:</strong><br />
                        <a href="tel:+381603304801" class="kontakt-link">060 330 4801</a>
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        <strong>Instagram:</strong><br />
                        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/agdesiti.culturepub/" target="_blank" class="kontakt-link">
                            agdesiti.culturepub
                        </a>
                    </p>
                </address>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <div class="map-responsive rounded shadow">
                    <iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d2808.653794856114!2d19.829965675414783!3d45.25479314738757!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x475b1100404769b7%3A0x32f166feb2ed96ef!2sA%20gde%20si%20ti!5e0!3m2!1sen!2srs!4v1760528199929!5m2!1sen!2srs"
                            width="600" height="450" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy"
                            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
                    </iframe>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="opis text-center">
            <p>
                Hoćeš da rezervišeš sto, predložiš događaj ili da samo kažeš <strong>“vidimo se večeras”</strong>?
                Piši nam, zovi nas, dođi lično — sve opcije su dobre dok vode do druženja.
            </p>
            <p>
                Mi nismo mesto koje se traži, nego ono <strong>gde se vraćaš.</strong>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>
